<title>FINLAND: TABLE - Nokia H1 profit up to FIM 3.33 bln.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Nokia H1 profit up to FIM 3.33 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June,</p>
<p>					 (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before tax, minority interst	3,331 vs 1,127</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   8.49 vs 2.97</p>
<p> Net sales					 24,392 vs 16,879</p>
<p> Operating profit				 3,370 vs 1,337</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish telecoms group Nokia Oy's first-half profit before tax and minorities had been 3.09 billion markka (range 2,966-3,300 million).</p>
<p>Nokia said its Q2 profit before tax and minorities was 1.88 billion markka. Analysts' median forecast had been 1.64 billion.</p>
</text>
